        "Figure 1 ODRL Information Model (Also available in SVG format)"
      ],
      "labels": [
        {
          "text": "A system that checks the conformance of ODRL Policy expressions, including the cardinality of properties and if they are",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            27.58,
            570.63,
            39.21
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "related to types of values as defined by the ODRL Information Model, and the Information Model's validation",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            39.39,
            521.21,
            51.02
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "requirements.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            51.21,
            116.7,
            62.83
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ODRL Evaluator",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            63.02,
            106.99,
            74.65
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-BoldItal"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A system that determines whether the Rules of an ODRL Policy expression have meet their intended action performance.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            74.83,
            568.0,
            86.46
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ODRL Core Vocabulary",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            86.64,
            136.45,
            98.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-BoldItal"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The set of terms that are represented by the ODRL Information Model.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            98.46,
            356.86,
            110.08
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ODRL Profile",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            110.27,
            93.56,
            121.9
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-BoldItal"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A community or sector specific vocabulary that extends the ODRL Core Vocabulary with new terms to express Policies",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            122.08,
            560.91,
            133.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ODRL Common Vocabulary",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            133.89,
            155.13,
            145.52
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-BoldItal"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A set of generic terms that may be re-used by ODRL Profiles.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            145.71,
            318.38,
            157.33
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2. ODRL Information Model",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            170.56,
            226.38,
            188.0
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            15.75
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ODRL Information Model represents Policies that express Permissions, Prohibitions and Duties related to the usage of Asset",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            201.49,
            575.01,
            213.11
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "resources. The Information Model explicitly expresses what is allowed and what is not allowed by the Policy, as well as other",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            213.3,
            560.5,
            224.93
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "terms, requirements, and parties involved. The aim of the ODRL Information Model is to enable flexible Policy expressions by",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            225.11,
            566.36,
            236.74
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "allowing the policy author to include as much, or as little, detail in the Policies.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            236.92,
            365.78,
            248.55
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The figure below shows the ODRL Information Model.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            259.24,
            265.91,
            270.86
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure 1 ODRL Information Model (Also available in SVG format)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            674.64,
            343.19,
            686.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ODRL Information Model has the following classes:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            696.96,
            273.21,
            708.58
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Policy - A non-empty group of Permissions (via the permission property) and/or Prohibitions (via the prohibition property)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            719.27,
            578.88,
            730.9
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and/or Duties (via the obligation property). The Policy class is the parent class to the Set, Offer, and Agreement subclasses:",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            731.08,
            576.32,
            742.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Set - a subclass of Policy that supports expressing generic Rules.",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            742.89,
            359.59,
            754.52
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 14,
      "rotation": 0,
      "drawings": 14,
      "rasterImagesOnPage": 1,
      "captionCandidates": [
        "Figure 2 ODRL Constraint Relationships (Also available in SVG format)"
      ],
      "labels": [
        {
          "text": "Figure 2 ODRL Constraint Relationships (Also available in SVG format)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            370.8,
            366.54,
            382.43
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2.5.1 Constraint Class",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            397.05,
            131.58,
            408.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint class is used for expressions which compare two operands (which are not Constraints) by one relational operator. If",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            422.64,
            573.03,
            434.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the comparison returns a match the Constraint is satisfied, otherwise it is not satisfied. The Constraint class formulates a",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            434.46,
            541.99,
            446.08
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "comparison expression, such as, the number of usages (the leftOperand) must be smaller than (the operator) the number 10",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            446.27,
            560.99,
            457.9
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(the rightOperand).",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            458.08,
            119.71,
            469.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Constraint class has the following properties:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            480.39,
            241.81,
            492.02
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MAY have none or one uid property value (of type IRI [rfc3987]) to identify the Constraint.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            502.71,
            500.43,
            514.33
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MUST have one leftOperand property value of type LeftOperand.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            514.52,
            396.58,
            526.15
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MUST have one operator property value of type Operator.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            526.33,
            364.25,
            537.96
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MUST have either:",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            538.14,
            194.58,
            549.77
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one rightOperand property value of type:",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            549.96,
            263.49,
            561.58
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "literal, or IRI [rfc3987], or RightOperand; or",
          "bbox": [
            111.75,
            561.77,
            299.54,
            573.4
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for set-based operators; list of literals, or list of IRIs [rfc3987], or list of RightOperands;",
          "bbox": [
            111.75,
            573.58,
            482.1,
            585.21
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one rightOperandReference property value of type:",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            585.39,
            309.73,
            597.02
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IRI [rfc3987]; or",
          "bbox": [
            111.75,
            597.21,
            182.31,
            608.83
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for set-based operators; list of IRIs [rfc3987];",
          "bbox": [
            111.75,
            609.02,
            303.03,
            620.65
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for a reference to a right operand value.",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            620.83,
            251.68,
            632.46
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MAY have none or one dataType property value for the data type of the rightOperand/Reference.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            632.64,
            522.3,
            644.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MAY have none or one unit property value (of type IRI [rfc3987]) to set the unit used for the value of the",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            644.46,
            558.92,
            656.08
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rightOperand/Reference.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            656.27,
            163.34,
            667.9
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Constraint MAY have none or one status property value for a value generated from the leftOperand action or for a value",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            668.08,
            576.75,
            679.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "related to the leftOperand set as the reference for the comparison.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            679.89,
            334.2,
            691.52
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The leftOperand property values are defined as instances of the LeftOperand class. The leftOperand instances MUST clearly",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            702.21,
            567.12,
            713.83
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be defined to indicate the semantics of the Constraint, and MAY declare how the value for comparison has to be retrieved or",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            714.02,
            553.81,
            725.65
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Bold",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "generated. The ODRL Common Vocabulary [odrl-vocab] defines leftOperand's that MAY be used by ODRL Profiles.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            725.83,
            528.63,
            737.46
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 19,
      "rotation": 0,
      "drawings": 15,
      "rasterImagesOnPage": 1,
      "captionCandidates": [
        "Figure 3 ODRL Rule Relationships (Also available in SVG format)"
      ],
      "labels": [
        {
          "text": "2.6 Rule Class",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            27.97,
            107.0,
            41.56
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.28
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Rule class is the parent of the Permission, Prohibition, and Duty classes. The Rule class represents the common",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            54.49,
            520.11,
            66.12
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "characteristics of these three classes. A Rule class MUST be disjoint with all other Rule subclasses.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            66.3,
            447.97,
            77.93
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Rule class has the following properties:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            88.61,
            217.89,
            100.24
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MUST have one action property value of type Action.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            110.93,
            321.32,
            122.55
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MAY have none or one relation sub-property values of type Asset.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            122.74,
            375.92,
            134.37
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MAY have none, one or many function sub-property values of type Party.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            134.55,
            403.23,
            146.18
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MAY have none, one or many failure sub-property values of type Rule.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            146.36,
            396.46,
            157.99
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MAY have none, one or many constraint property values of type Constraint/LogicalConstraint.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            158.18,
            496.46,
            169.8
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Rule MAY have none or one uid property values (of type IRI [rfc3987]) to identify the Rule so it MAY be referenced by",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            169.99,
            570.09,
            181.62
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "other Rules.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            181.8,
            110.0,
            193.43
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Note: The above property cardinalities reflect the normative ODRL Information Model. In some cases, repeat occurrences of",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            204.11,
            557.24,
            215.74
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "some properties are also supported (as described in Policy Rule Composition and Compact Policy) but the normative atomic",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            215.93,
            555.3,
            227.55
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Policy is consistent with the above property cardinalities.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            227.74,
            273.31,
            239.37
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Explicit sub-properties of the abstract relation, relation and failure properties must be used, the choice depending on the",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            250.05,
            562.61,
            261.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "subclass of Rule in question.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            261.86,
            153.46,
            273.49
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The three classes of Rules also form important relationships with the Duty Rule. The property relationships are summarised in the",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            284.18,
            578.71,
            295.8
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "figure below.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            295.99,
            88.3,
            307.62
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure 3 ODRL Rule Relationships (Also available in SVG format)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            492.86,
            342.62,
            504.49
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2.6.1 Permission Class",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            518.46,
            132.75,
            530.08
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Permission allows an action, with all refinements satisfied, to be exercised on an Asset if all constraints are satisfied and if all",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            544.05,
            575.22,
            555.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duties are fulfilled.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            555.86,
            113.78,
            567.49
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Permission class is a subclass of, and inherits all the properties from, the Rule class - and has the following additional",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            578.18,
            545.99,
            589.8
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "property semantics:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            589.99,
            115.53,
            601.62
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Permission MUST have one target property value of type Asset. (Other relation sub-properties MAY be used.)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            612.3,
            542.94,
            623.93
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Permission MAY have none or one assigner and/or assignee property values (of type Party) for functional roles. (Other",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            624.11,
            577.41,
            635.74
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "function sub-properties MAY be used.)",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            635.93,
            226.62,
            647.55
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono-Oblique",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Permission MAY have none, one, or more duty property values of type Duty.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            647.74,
            391.15,
            659.37
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Note: The above property cardinalities reflect the normative ODRL Information Model. In some cases, repeat occurrences of",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            670.05,
            557.24,
            681.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "some properties are also supported (as described in Policy Rule Composition and Compact Policy) but the normative atomic",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            681.86,
            555.3,
            693.49
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Policy is consistent with the above property cardinalities.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            693.68,
            273.31,
            705.3
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The duty property expresses an agreed obligation that MUST be fulfilled. That is, the duty property asserts a pre-condition",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            715.99,
            546.22,
            727.62
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "between the Permission and the Duty. See the Duty with a Permission section for more details.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            727.8,
            430.39,
            739.43
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
