        "Figure 4 ODRL Shared Properties (Also available in SVG format)"
      ],
      "labels": [
        {
          "text": "1. Where there are multiple Assets (with the same relation), then replace the existing Rule by newly created Rules (one for",
          "bbox": [
            48.75,
            27.58,
            563.12,
            39.21
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "each of these Assets) and include only one Asset relation, and include all other (non-Asset) properties, in each Rule",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            39.39,
            543.31,
            51.02
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Where there are multiple Parties (with the same function), then replace the existing Rule by newly created Rules (one for",
          "bbox": [
            48.75,
            51.21,
            567.81,
            62.83
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "each of these Parties) and include only one Party function, and include all other (non-Party) properties, in each Rule.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            63.02,
            548.86,
            74.65
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "3. Where there are multiple Actions, then replace the existing Rule by newly created Rules (one for each of these Actions)",
          "bbox": [
            48.75,
            74.83,
            561.32,
            86.46
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and include only one Action, and include all other (non-Action) properties, in each Rule.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            86.64,
            431.35,
            98.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
