          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2.7.1 Compact Policy",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            112.24,
            127.49,
            123.86
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif-Bold"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An ODRL Policy MAY hold properties, declared at the Policy-level, which are shared and common to all its Rules. This is aimed",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            138.49,
            573.07,
            150.11
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "only as a short-cut method to support more compact serialisations. These shared properties MUST NOT be interpreted as Policy-",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            150.3,
            574.74,
            161.93
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Bold",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "level properties (such as those defined in the Policy Class section).",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            162.11,
            313.23,
            173.74
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Properties that MAY be shared (as shown in the figure below) include:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            184.42,
            326.66,
            196.05
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One or many action properties.",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            206.74,
            194.76,
            218.36
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "DejaVuSansMono",
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.53,
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One or many sub-properties of relation (such as target).",
          "bbox": [
            59.25,
            218.55,
            308.16,
            230.18
