          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ODRL validation requirements for expanding short-cuts in a Policy is:",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            460.71,
            347.58,
            472.33
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "1. For each Rule in the Policy:",
          "bbox": [
            48.75,
            483.02,
            176.79,
            494.65
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify any relevant shared properties (at the Policy-level).",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            494.83,
            329.27,
            506.46
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Replicate these properties in the Rule.",
          "bbox": [
            85.5,
            506.64,
            245.31,
            518.27
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Remove the shared properties declared at the Policy-level",
          "bbox": [
            48.75,
            518.46,
            301.57,
            530.08
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Further, follow the ODRL validation requirements to create atomic Rules in the Policy (defined in the previous section).",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            540.77,
            537.55,
            552.4
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is RECOMMENDED that compact ODRL Policies be expanded to atomic Policies when being processed for conformance.",
          "bbox": [
            33.0,
            563.08,
            558.39,
            574.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "LiberationSerif",
            "LiberationSerif-Italic"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            10.5
          ]
